---
// $ whoami — the human.
---
<section id="whoami" class="relative border-t border-term-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 md:py-28">
    <p class="reveal text-sm text-term-faint">
      <span class="term-prompt font-bold">supian@octopy</span><span class="text-term-faint">:</span><span class="term-path">~</span><span class="text-term-faint">$</span>
      <span class="text-term-text"> whoami</span>
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-14">
      <div class="reveal md:col-span-4">
        <div class="term-window overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/images/supian.webp"
            alt="Supian M., founder of Octopy"
            class="aspect-square w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <p class="border-t border-term-line px-4 py-3 text-xs text-term-faint">
            ~/portrait.png · 880×880
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-8">
        <p class="reveal text-sm text-term-faint">
          <span class="text-term-faint">$</span> <span class="text-term-text">cat founder.txt</span>
        </p>
        <div class="reveal mt-5 space-y-5 leading-8 text-term-text/85" style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
          <p>
            I&rsquo;m Supian M. I build with Laravel and PHP &mdash; and I maintain a few
            open-source packages in that ecosystem, most notably
            <a
              href="https://github.com/octopyid/laravel-impersonate"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-term-cyan underline decoration-term-cyan/40 underline-offset-4 hover:text-term-text"
              >laravel-impersonate</a
            >, a user-impersonation package with 300+ stars on GitHub.
          </p>
          <p>
            Beyond packages, I work where code meets infrastructure: web applications on top,
            Linux servers underneath &mdash; for government agencies and private clients.
            Everything I ship is meant to run quietly in production.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="reveal mt-8 text-sm text-term-faint" style="--reveal-delay: 140ms">
          <span class="text-term-faint">$</span> <span class="text-term-text">cat principles.conf</span>
        </p>
        <ul class="reveal mt-4 space-y-3 text-[15px]" style="--reveal-delay: 180ms">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-term-green">#</span>
            <span><span class="text-term-text">full-lifecycle ownership</span> <span class="text-term-faint">— bare metal to frontend</span></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-term-green">#</span>
            <span><span class="text-term-text">pragmatic architecture</span> <span class="text-term-faint">— no over-engineering</span></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-term-green">#</span>
            <span><span class="text-term-text">open source, maintained</span> <span class="text-term-faint">— used in production by Laravel teams</span></span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="reveal mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-md border border-term-line bg-term-panel px-4 py-2 text-xs text-term-dim" style="--reveal-delay: 220ms">
          <i class="ph-duotone ph-map-pin text-base text-term-green"></i>
          Indonesia — working worldwide
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
